[[Megaton Blast (Insane)|Event All-Stars Grand Jubilee!]]
|money drop = 1¢ - 4¢
}}

==Enemy==
Snowballs travel from the enemy base to the Cat Base at high speed. After hitting a single time, they remain on the ground until cleared out by an attack. Although they only have 1HP, due to their high spawn rate, they can still overwhelm players without good methods of area attack. In addition, their damage and spawn rate increases throughout the event, increasing their threat level with every stage. They are similar to [[Brollow]] as they attack fast and hard, but with large backswing and a small health pool.

==Strategy==
Good defense is necessary to endure the snowballs, particularly in the form of meatshields. In addition, cats that can perform [[Wave Attack]]s ([[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] etc.) can easily clear the path of many snowballs. Snowballs can be cleared when they are flying to the Cats by any kind of attack. However, their quick speed makes it so that most cats cannot hit them in time. [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] can be useful against them in small numbers, but the massive amounts of snowballs in later stages will easily break him down. [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] is a noteworthy exception, as it completely obliterates snowballs; it outranges them, attacks extremely quickly, its mediocre damage-per-hit isn't an issue, and has Area Attack to clear out large amounts of snowballs.

